        <mxCell id="dest_agy" value="&lt;b&gt;Approved Developers Surface (Google Antigravity)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;• Outside Workspace File Access = &lt;b&gt;Deny&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Terminal Execution Policy = &lt;b&gt;Require review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Terminal Sandbox = &lt;b&gt;Enabled&lt;/b&gt; · Metadata Logging = &lt;b&gt;Enabled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Allowed MCP JSON: &lt;b&gt;bigquery&lt;/b&gt; + &lt;b&gt;local-copy-auditor&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0288D1;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
